OL,3,GNEWSAFerry cancels rest of season over
OL,4,Aengine problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry company has taken the
OL,7,F"difficult decision" to end its season
OL,8,Fearly to avoid passenger uncertainty
OL,9,Fafter problems with its only ship's
OL,10,Fstarboard main engine.
OL,12,FIslands Unlimited said it would take
OL,13,Ftoo long to source, install and test a
OL,14,Freplacement engine part for the 316
OL,15,Fseat high-speed passenger catamaran San
OL,16,FPawl.
OL,18,FThe daily service between Guernsey and
OL,19,FJersey, with weekend sailings to
OL,20,FAlderney, was due to run until Sunday
OL,21,F18 October, but was halted last week.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
