OL,3,GNEWSAFerry cancels rest of season over
OL,4,Aengine problem
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslands Unlimited said the cause of the
OL,7,Fproblem was found after extensive
OL,8,Ftechnical investigation and it
OL,9,Frecognised "the disruption and
OL,10,Fdisappointment this will cause,
OL,11,Fparticularly for passengers with
OL,12,Fupcoming travel plans".
